    "description": "Give the person's records (each with title, kind, running, updatedAt and an optional progress value), the unread count and, optionally, the next calendar line. Returns the mark's message: its count, whether anything is working, how many are running, the now line (the newest running record with its progress rounded to two places, or the next line when nothing runs, or null) and the first eight running titles. Nothing is read or written here.",
